```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant agent as MCP client (agent)
    participant mcp as MCP handler<br/>/api/v1/mcp/
    participant policy as kit/runtime/policy
    participant bus as kit/runtime/bus
    participant svc as Service layer
    participant store as Storage driver

    agent->>mcp: tools/call search(query="auth bug", profile="work")
    mcp->>bus: emit dpkms.mcp.tool.invoked
    bus->>policy: deliver to subscribers
    policy-->>mcp: allow (or veto)

    alt vetoed by policy
        mcp-->>agent: error: blocked by rule
        mcp->>bus: emit dpkms.mcp.tool.failed
    else allowed
        mcp->>svc: SearchObjects(query, profile_id="work", top_k=10)
        svc->>store: FTS5 BM25 + vector rerank
        store-->>svc: rows
        svc-->>mcp: results
        mcp->>bus: emit dpkms.mcp.tool.completed
        mcp-->>agent: ToolResult{json: [...]}
    end
```
